sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Caller as API caller
    participant CallLog as CallLogMiddleware<br/>src/todo/api/grpc/middleware/call_log/middleware.py
    participant AnswerFailures as AnswerFailuresMiddleware<br/>src/todo/api/grpc/middleware/answer_failures/middleware.py
    participant Endpoint as ItemsHandler<br/>src/todo/api/grpc/endpoint/items.py
    participant Handler as PlanItemsHandler<br/>src/todo/command/plan_items.py

    Caller->>+CallLog: /todo.v1.ItemsService/PlanItems
    Note over CallLog: takes or makes the request id, record "grpc call received"
    CallLog->>+AnswerFailures: the call
    AnswerFailures->>+Endpoint: the method of the contract
    Note over Endpoint: decodes the message into PlanItems
    Endpoint->>+Handler: PlanItems, through the command middleware
    Handler-->>-Endpoint: the result, or an error with its kind
    Endpoint-->>-AnswerFailures: the response message, or the error
    Note over AnswerFailures: the kind to its gRPC status, a panic to INTERNAL
    AnswerFailures-->>-CallLog: the answer
    Note over CallLog: record "grpc call answered"
    CallLog-->>-Caller: the response, or the status
